    <string name="ui_fragment_about_us_text_0" formatted="false">About DietPal\n\nDietPal is a bachelor coursework application by Ahmad Sajjad Siddiqui. It combines a local account demo, a BMI calculation, timed workout screens and optional recipe browsing.\n\nThis portfolio edition includes documented fixes and replacement artwork prepared in October 2026. The original submission is preserved separately.</string>
