    <string name="ui_fragment_privacy_policy_text_0" formatted="false">Data in this demo\n\nA registered username, email address and salted password hash are stored locally on this device. Android cloud backup is disabled for this build.\n\nBMI inputs are used for the current calculation; the app has no BMI-history feature.\n\nWhen a developer configures recipe browsing, search tags, recipe IDs and the configured API key are sent to Spoonacular. Recipe images may be loaded from the image addresses returned by that service.\n\nClear the app storage or uninstall the app to remove its local account data.</string>
